  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.4.1`\n\n### Features\n\n- implement SessionHub for shared SSH connections across tunnels ([54c8abdf](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/54c8abdf45899908031f84f6febffc8cc6da8906))\n- enhance SSH config import with port forwarding support ([e1334294](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/e133429425377295e7e0e519190472a80fb60caf))\n- implement quit confirmation for running tunnels before application exit ([4cfdc756](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/4cfdc756fe280de01c4270edfb2bb0a32cc56b20))\n- implement Listeners struct for multi-address socket binding and connection handling ([9b00b602](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/9b00b602ca4f7ed3266faf9578ae57d1c2622572))\n- add auto-start functionality and credential handling ([42216093](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/42216093dae9a4e5d70e4a880bb260ecf27d8ca8))\n- implement TunnelRoute component and associated styles ([0cccecc5](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/0cccecc514dc21e15fcfcb5171a7fb1d94d62aee))\n- implement decayed attempt logic for SSH reconnects to improve retry handling ([845a519a](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/845a519a2ad2a75919eb214234baf3272c4ddb0a))\n\n### Performance\n\n- enhance tunnel failure handling and reporting in UI ([86ae8972](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/86ae8972cb99509c30e8885c325385751e662f6d))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.4.1...v0.4.2-beta.1](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.4.1...v0.4.2-beta.1)\n",
